<title>USA: Harold's Stores sees revs $105 mln for fy'97.</title>
<headline>Harold's Stores sees revs $105 mln for fy'97.</headline>
<dateline>NORMAN, OKLA. 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Harold's Stores Inc said it expects its sales for fiscal 1997 to exceed $105 million, compared with sales of $94 million for fiscal 1996.</p>
<p>The company, whose current fiscal year ends February 1, did not say how much it expected to earn per share.</p>
<p>Officials from the company were not immediately available to comment.</p>
</text>
